<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 760 276" width="760" height="276" role="img">
<title>Latency per operation at the knee</title>
<desc>Each operation of example-mix at the knee, 180.8/s offered, at the quantile it is judged at, beside its budget.</desc>
<style>
text { fill: #52514e; font: 12px -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; }
.title { fill: #0b0b0b; font-weight: 600; }
.muted { fill: #8a8880; font-size: 11px; }
.grid { stroke: #e4e2dd; stroke-width: 1; }
.axis { stroke: #8a8880; stroke-width: 1; }
.p50 { stroke: #7db4ea; fill: #7db4ea; } .p95 { stroke: #3d7fd0; fill: #3d7fd0; }
.p99 { stroke: #1b4f94; fill: #1b4f94; }
.line { fill: none; stroke-width: 2.2; }
.scoutline { fill: none; stroke-width: 1; stroke-opacity: 0.55; }
.hollow { fill: #ffffff; stroke-width: 1.4; }
.nr { fill: none; stroke-width: 1.4; }
.fit { fill: none; stroke: #6b6a64; stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-dasharray: 7 4; }
.identity { stroke: #8a8880; stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
.bracket { fill: #1baf7a; fill-opacity: 0.12; stroke: #1baf7a; stroke-width: 1; }
.ok { fill: #1baf7a; stroke: #1baf7a; } .bad { fill: #b3261e; stroke: #b3261e; }
.okt { fill: #1baf7a; } .badt { fill: #b3261e; }
.bar { fill: #3d7fd0; }
.budget { stroke: #b3261e; stroke-width: 2; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
text { fill: #c3c2b7; }
.title { fill: #ffffff; }
.muted { fill: #8f8e85; }
.grid { stroke: #3a3a38; }
.axis { stroke: #8f8e85; }
.p50 { stroke: #3d5f82; fill: #3d5f82; } .p95 { stroke: #3987e5; fill: #3987e5; }
.p99 { stroke: #9ec7ef; fill: #9ec7ef; }
.hollow { fill: #1d1d1b; }
.fit { stroke: #a8a79e; }
.identity { stroke: #8f8e85; }
.bracket { fill: #26c78d; stroke: #26c78d; }
.ok { fill: #26c78d; stroke: #26c78d; } .bad { fill: #e5484d; stroke: #e5484d; }
.okt { fill: #26c78d; } .badt { fill: #e5484d; }
.bar { fill: #3987e5; }
.budget { stroke: #e5484d; }
}
</style>
